1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,467
Night seven. 3:09 AM. Last night. Rain
again.

2
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:07,133
The bell rings once. The man in the
old jacket is back.

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:08,267
Coffee.

4
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:12,400
One coffee. Black. No receipt.

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,967
His hands shake. He looks at you for
the first time.

6
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:21,167
For six nights you were afraid of him.
Tonight you realize he was afraid,
too.

7
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:25,400
Afraid that you'd be like all the
others. Afraid you'd leave.
